    "name": "Corporate Food API",
    "description": "Complete REST API collection for the Corporate Food Ordering System.\n\n**Base URL:** `{{baseUrl}}` (default `http://localhost:8081`)\n\n**Seed data** (from `V1__init_schema.sql`):\n| Resource | IDs / values |\n|---|---|\n| Companies | 1=گروه الین, 2=شرکت لمون, 3=شرکت الین, 4=شرکت شمس |\n| Employees | 1=admin1 (ADMIN), 2=manager1 (MANAGER), 3=emp1 (EMPLOYEE) — password: `password` |\n| Foods | 1–7 |\n| Working week | 1 (week 4, year 1405) |\n| Week days | 1=شنبه … 7=جمعه |\n| Food order | 1 (employee 1, week 1, day 1, food 1) |\n\n**Auth:** `app.security.enabled` defaults to `false` (no auth). When `true`, enable collection **Basic Auth** with `{{authUsername}}` / `{{authPassword}}`.\n\n**Response envelope:** All endpoints return `ApiResponse<T>` with `success`, `message`, `data`, `timestamp`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "basic",
    "basic": [
      { "key": "username", "value": "{{authUsername}}", "type": "string" },
      { "key": "password", "value": "{{authPassword}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8081" },
    { "key": "authUsername", "value": "emp1" },
